00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.852
- Okay, this looks exactly the same.

00:02:26.852 --> 00:02:27.890
Hi.
- Well this is all good,

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.830
except now we have a security office.

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.290
- Cheerleading was one
of like the only things

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.410
that really got me through
some of like my darkest times.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:37.040
You know, for 17 years, as
like trapped and sad as I was,

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:39.330
I did have so many little pockets of joy

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:41.380
where I was performing
and having so much fun

00:02:41.380 --> 00:02:43.830
and I was just in my skin and loving it,

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.170
even when when it was hard.

00:02:45.170 --> 00:02:46.060
How you feeling?

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.530
- Just completely overwhelmed
(laughs) with excitement,

00:02:49.530 --> 00:02:51.920
and levels of emotion are just,

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.380
I am just so proud of you,

00:02:53.380 --> 00:02:55.340
and I always feel so blessed that we met

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:57.740
all these wonderful friends and people.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:03:00.600
I almost feel a little bit, like you know,

00:03:00.600 --> 00:03:02.900
undeserving of all this attention,

00:03:02.900 --> 00:03:06.930
but I know like I've worked
hard on just saying thank you.

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.410
- Well, I just want you to appreciate

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.780
the endless well of energy

00:03:09.780 --> 00:03:11.680
that you give everyone around you,

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:14.430
and the changes that you make
in people's lives, and...

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.628
I was very excited to come,
but I was also very nervous,

00:03:18.628 --> 00:03:23.190
I was very excited to come,
but I was also very nervous,

00:03:23.190 --> 00:03:24.101
and, you know, Quincy,
like, ever since I've left,

00:03:24.101 --> 00:03:27.980
and, you know, Quincy,
like, ever since I've left,

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:32.880
has had a very particular kind
of painful place in my heart,

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:35.630
'cause it was very, as much
as I loved being a Blue Devil

00:03:35.630 --> 00:03:38.470
and having an experience
here, it was very hard.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:40.610
But one thing that you did, you know,

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.310
for me and other kids like me,

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.880
is you always treated me the same as,

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:46.883
as if I was like anyone else.

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:51.700
And as an LGBT person, I think, you know,

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.830
so badly like we just want to feel normal,

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.250
and like not treated differently.

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.280
You always did that.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:04:00.650
And, I just feel like my scars

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:03.113
were very much healed, like this week.

00:04:03.113 --> 00:04:05.600
It just, it really is very moving,

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.793
and you have such a part in that.

00:04:10.203 --> 00:04:14.373
And you have literally saved
people's lives, mine included.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.100
That is big words that I just said,

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:18.070
so I just want you to be able to

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.420
keep giving back to yourself,

00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:21.650
so that you can keep
doing what you love to do.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:24.110
- Thank you, 'cause
that, well the arts are a

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:26.660
amazing, amazing vehicle to, you know,

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:29.420
be able to, you know, cry and emote

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.820
and bring all those
emotions to the forefront,

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:34.602
so that we can all share
what makes us human.

00:04:34.602 --> 00:04:35.980
- Yeah.
- Like we couldn't be more,

00:04:35.980 --> 00:04:38.048
more proud of you, and so
- I love you to pieces, Kathi.

00:04:38.048 --> 00:04:39.548
Thank you so much.

